	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Starting at 7th level, either through your heroic deeds or your iron fist, you receive an average Grade 1 stronghold. This stronghold must be one of the following: castle, encampment, or guildhall. Unlike normal strongholds, this stronghold cannot be sold.</p><p>Additionally, your shield acts as a wall, even for your allies. If any ally that is adjacent to you when you are wielding a shield would be hit by a critical hit, you may use your reaction to sacrifice your shield to turn the critical hit into a regular hit instead.</p>",
